{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Caterpillar King</i> is a short, cozy strategy adventure wrapped in absurd humor and adorableness.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a bug family on a 2D grid. Guide the little Caterpillar to safety using unique bug abilities! Push, swap, and shield your way out of danger!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan ahead and coordinate movement and actions to get the best results.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return the lost prince home and find comfort in found family in this heartfelt, storybook adventure. Discover an absurd and cute world, and relax to a mesmerizing soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A short, story-driven adventure</strong> about teamwork and belonging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-drawn, colorful art</strong> inspired by children\u2019s storybooks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light tactical puzzles</strong>.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A charming cast of bug friends,</strong> each with unique abilities and personalities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A cozy soundtrack</strong> to relax to while you guide the little Caterpillar home.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3916610?t=1765231298","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3916610?t=1765231298","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916610/72729503e4f1e32889b53e17d865aafc6d14ba57/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765231298","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916610/72729503e4f1e32889b53e17d865aafc6d14ba57/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765231298","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Caterpillar King</i> is a short, cozy strategy adventure wrapped in absurd humor and adorableness.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a bug family on a 2D grid. Guide the little Caterpillar to safety using unique bug abilities! Push, swap, and shield your way out of danger!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan ahead and coordinate movement and actions to get the best results.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return the lost prince home and find comfort in found family in this heartfelt, storybook adventure. Discover an absurd and cute world, and relax to a mesmerizing soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A short, story-driven adventure</strong> about teamwork and belonging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-drawn, colorful art</strong> inspired by children\u2019s storybooks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light tactical puzzles</strong>.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A charming cast of bug friends,</strong> each with unique abilities and personalities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A cozy soundtrack</strong> to relax to while you guide the little Caterpillar home.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Kabob Lover"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916610/09ec520016b53d7f065c0e3620ff60c9e9171a07/header.jpg?t=1765231298","